      "text": "Proof of the volume conjecture for Whitehead chains — We prove the volume conjecture for an inﬁnite family of links called White- head chains that generalizes both the Whitehead link and the\n\n**Proof of the volume conjecture for Whitehead chains**\n\n*Roland van der Veen*\n\n13 pp, 4 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We prove the volume conjecture for an inﬁnite family of links called White- head chains that generalizes both the Whitehead link and the Borromean rings.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; Proof of the main theorem; Proof of the lemmas",
